# Cross-origin isolation enables SharedArrayBuffer -> multi-threaded WebAssembly for the CPU model path.
# All cross-origin resources we load (imgly CDN, Polar, our worker) send CORS/CORP headers, so require-corp is safe.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
